<title>USA: Western Resources to challenge warrant.</title>
<headline>Western Resources to challenge warrant.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Resources Inc said Tuesday it filed a motion with a federal court in Florida seeking to enjoin or prohibit Republic Industries Inc from transferring or selling 15 million shares of ADT Ltd common shares.</p>
<p>Western Resources said Republic exercised a warrant, which it received in connection with its failed attempt to merge with ADT last summer, to receive the 15 million ADT shares.</p>
<p>Republic officials were not available to comment on the Western Resources filing.</p>
<p>Western Resources, which is a diversified energy company, is locked in a hostile takeover battle with Tyco International Ltd for control of ADT.</p>
<p>Western Resources shares closed up 5/8 Tuesday at 31-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
